    {
      "section": "2D Model Picker",
      "text": "**A DeepSeek Harness plugin: pick a model and its reasoning effort in one drag.**\n\n**English** · [简体中文](https://github.com/Fyerl/dsh-2d-model-picker/blob/main/README-zh-CN.md)\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-2d-model-picker)\n[](https://github.com/Fyerl/dsh-2d-model-picker/stargazers)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Demo",
      "text": "https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b0005a1d-4ca0-4277-ae39-b0ab28f7a206"
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick start",
      "text": "In DSH, open **Plugins → Add plugin** and enter:\n\n```text\ndsh-2d-model-picker\n```\n\nOr use the CLI for the **Web profile**:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-2d-model-picker\n```\n\nFor Discover, enable **Custom plugin indexes** under **Experimental plugins**, then add [this index](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fyerl/dsh-2d-model-picker/main/docs/index.json) in **Plugins → Discover**."
    },
    {
      "section": "What is 2D Model Picker?",
      "text": "2D Model Picker is a DeepSeek Harness plugin that replaces the native model picker with a two-dimensional grid: **rows are models, columns are reasoning-effort tiers**. Drag to a supported combination and release to apply it.\n\n---\n\n[Contributing](https://github.com/Fyerl/dsh-2d-model-picker/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) · [MIT License](https://github.com/Fyerl/dsh-2d-model-picker/blob/main/LICENSE)"
    }
